{"subject": "📊 Daily Portfolio: Flat (100% cash) | AXTI +27% / KPTI -70% — AMD earnings tomorrow", "html_body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f5f7; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #111827;\">\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color: #f4f5f7; padding: 24px 12px;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- HERO BANNER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #334155 100%); padding: 32px 24px; color: #ffffff;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #94a3b8;\">Daily Portfolio Check</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #cbd5e1;\">Monday, August 3, 2026 — Kuwait time</p>\n\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n              <tr>\n                <td>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Total P&amp;L</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; color: #94a3b8;\">$0.00 <span style=\"font-size: 18px; opacity: 0.8;\">(0.00%)</span></p>\n                </td>\n                <td align=\"right\" valign=\"bottom\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Today</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #94a3b8;\">$0.00 (—)</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #e2e8f0;\">🎯 <strong>Investment goal:</strong> $546.58 / $1,000 — <strong style=\"color:#cbd5e1;\">$453.42 to go</strong> (54.7% there)</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8;\">⚠️ Target date (Jul 31, 2026) has passed without hitting goal — consider resetting the date, this doesn't change exit/entry rules.</p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 16px 0 0 0; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #475569; font-size: 13px; color: #e2e8f0;\">Fully in cash, 7th trading day since the CAPR stop-out (Jul 27). No open positions. AMD reports tomorrow (Aug 4), LLY Wednesday (Aug 5) — neither is a current holding.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- MACRO CONTEXT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px; background-color: #0d0d0d; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #f59e0b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">🌍 Macro Context — Aug 3, 2026</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #e5e7eb;\">\n              <tr><td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">Buffett Indicator:</td><td style=\"text-align:right; font-weight:600;\">229.9% <span style=\"background-color:#7f1d1d; color:#fecaca; padding:1px 8px; border-radius:10px; font-size:11px; margin-left:6px;\">🔴 ALL-TIME EXTREME</span></td></tr>\n              <tr><td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">S&amp;P Forward P/E:</td><td style=\"text-align:right; font-weight:600;\">~22x <span style=\"color:#9ca3af; font-size:11px;\">(vs. ~17x long-run avg)</span></td></tr>\n              <tr><td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">Trend:</td><td style=\"text-align:right; font-weight:600;\">→ Roughly flat <span style=\"color:#9ca3af; font-size:11px;\">(229.9% vs 232.5% in June)</span></td></tr>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #d1d5db; line-height: 1.5;\">Market cap is 2.3× the entire US economy, a hair below June's all-time reading — every prior episode this high has preceded a multi-year drawdown. Forward P/E near 22x is priced for continued beat-and-raise, which is exactly what AMD and LLY need to deliver this week.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #d1d5db; line-height: 1.5;\">Implication for you: sitting in cash isn't costing you much right now — the macro backdrop rewards patience over forcing a new entry into a stretched tape.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 10px; color: #6b7280; font-style: italic;\">Last historical episodes at this level: 2000 dot-com peak, 2021 COVID bubble peak.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- POSITION NEWS -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px; background-color: #f9fafb; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">📰 Position News</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #4b5563;\">No open positions — nothing to scan today. Enhanced monitoring resumes automatically once a new position is opened.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- POSITION SNAPSHOT TABLE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">Position Snapshot</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Status</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Close</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Day</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">P&amp;L $</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">P&amp;L %</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 16px 8px; text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; font-style: italic;\">No open positions — 100% cash ($546.58)</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 12px 8px; font-weight: 700;\">TOTAL</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: right; color: #6b7280;\">—</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: right; color: #6b7280;\">—</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: right; font-weight: 700; color: #6b7280;\">$0.00</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: right; font-weight: 700; color: #6b7280;\">0.00%</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- MOVERS -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">📈📉 Friday's Movers — Jul 31, 2026</p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #059669;\">Top Gainer</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:right; padding:8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">%</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">What happened</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Type</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Note</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:600;\">AXTI</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align:right; color:#059669; font-weight:600;\">+27%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Q2 beat: rev $47.6M vs $34.1M est (+165% YoY), EPS $0.19 vs $0.07 est. Record indium phosphide sales tied to AI data-center optical transceivers.</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Earnings</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; color:#9ca3af;\">None — no held/watchlist overlap</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #dc2626;\">Top Loser</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:right; padding:8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">%</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">What happened</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Type</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Contagion?</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:600;\">KPTI</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align:right; color:#dc2626; font-weight:600;\">-70%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Phase 3 XPORT-EC-042 (selinexor, endometrial cancer) missed its primary PFS endpoint — trended favorable but not statistically significant.</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Trial miss</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; color:#9ca3af;\">None directly, but same pattern as CELC/CAPR/VERA — another reminder why binary-catalyst biotech trading is paused.</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- LARGE CAP ON DECK -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">🏢 Large-cap on deck — next 21 days</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Event</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Date</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Setup</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Direction</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:600;\">AMD</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Earnings (Q2)</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Aug 4, AC</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Guided ~46% YoY rev growth, 56% gross margin; Street at $11.32B/$1.61 EPS; options imply ~12% move.</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">🟢 Bullish</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:600;\">LLY</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Earnings (Q2)</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Aug 5, BO</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Mounjaro/Zepbound momentum strong, but bar is \"raise guidance enough to satisfy an already-optimistic market\" — priced for perfection.</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">⚪ Neutral</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #4b5563;\">💡 <strong>AMD earnings Aug 4</strong> — strong guide, Strong Buy consensus. Say <em>analyze AMD</em> for the full setup if you want an entry read before or after the print.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- PENDING WATCHLIST -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #1a1400; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #fbbf24;\">⏳ Pending Watchlist</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #fde68a; line-height: 1.6;\">No live watchlist entries. The 4 names in portfolio.json (CELC, CAPR, VRDN, VERA) are all archived — closed positions or missed entries from the paused binary-catalyst strategy, kept for reference only. Nothing is currently pending an entry decision.</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #fcd34d;\">New candidates come from <strong>stock-finder</strong> (runs Tue/Sun) — say <em>find me something</em> anytime for an on-demand scan.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- CASH DEPLOYMENT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #166534;\">💵 Cash deployment — $544.58 available</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #14532d; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                    No fresh discovery candidate is generated automatically here — that's what <strong>stock-finder</strong> is for.<br>\n                    No existing position to add to — you've been fully in cash 7 trading days since the CAPR stop-out.<br>\n                    <strong>Your call.</strong> Worth running stock-finder given the idle stretch, or waiting to see how AMD (tomorrow) and LLY (Wednesday) trade before committing fresh capital into a stretched tape (Buffett Indicator 229.9%).\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- IBKR INTELLIGENCE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af;\">📊 IBKR Intelligence — not available in routine mode. Trigger daily check in chat for full broker analytics.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- EDUCATION MODULE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">📚 Today you learned</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a;\">Multiple Expansion (and Compression)</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.7;\">\n                    AMD and LLY both report this week with a high bar already priced in — this is where multiple expansion (or its evil twin, compression) actually plays out. Price = earnings × the multiple the market assigns those earnings. When a company beats estimates but the stock sells off anyway, that's compression: the market decided the current multiple already reflected the good news, beat or not. It's exactly why your old NVDA position stalled even as the underlying business kept growing — the multiple came in faster than earnings grew. At a 229.9% Buffett Indicator reading, that's the market's current mood: priced for perfection, punishing anything short of it. Watch how AMD and LLY react tomorrow and Wednesday for a live example either way.\n                  </p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #475569; font-style: italic;\">\n                    Also today: IV crush — after AMD/LLY print, expect implied volatility (and options premiums) to collapse regardless of direction; the options market already got paid for the move, right or wrong.\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- FOOTER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 24px 24px; border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 10px; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.5;\">\n              Research output, not financial advice. Past performance does not guarantee future results.\n              Verify halal compliance quarterly on Zoya or Musaffa. Prices: Yahoo Finance JSON API / web search — Aug 3, 2026 06:00 Kuwait time (no open positions to price).\n              Generated Aug 3, 2026, Kuwait time.\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}